      "kind": "paragraph",
      "topic": "AES 模式误用（ECB / CBC）",
      "section": [
        "AES 模式误用（ECB / CBC）",
        "When"
      ],
      "content": "ECB 出现重复块；CBC 有可控 IV/明文且无认证；或存在 padding oracle。",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 14,
      "truncated": false
    },
