      ],
      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 16,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/crypto-aes-mode-misuse.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:b6eea2b82ce288cc017f0b6bdfeeffc6dae8acaffa6d2e0938260643b28555f3",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "AES 模式误用（ECB / CBC）",
      "section": [
        "AES 模式误用（ECB / CBC）",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. ECB：找相同密文块，重排/拼接块，观察明文结构或权限字段。\n2. CBC 位翻转：改 C_{i-1} 的字节，精确翻转 P_i 的对应字节（保留后续块损坏）。\n3. CBC IV 可控时翻转首块；有 padding oracle 时按字节恢复明文。\n4. 每次改动后只提交一次，记录服务端响应差异。",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20,
      "truncated": false
    },
